	n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				TICKETING INFO\nSeason tick
	ets are available. 6-show packages start at just $34 per-show. \nTickets a
	re $46 and are available online or by calling TUTS Guest Services at 713-5
	58-8887. Tickets will also available in person Monday through Friday from 
	Noon to 6 p.m. at the TUTS Box Office\, located in the Hobby Center lobby.
	 \nDiscounted group tickets are available for parties of 10 or more.Theatr
	e Under The Stars has a variety of accessibility options for guests.Learn 
	more about accessible performances and other services here. \nRush tickets
	 will be available for $35 at the box office for mezzanine and gallery sea
	ting starting 2 hours prior to curtain. \nQuestions about parking\, dining
	 or other aspects of attending a TUTS show? We’ve got answers! \n			\n				
